  "details": "Usually this was never an issue until the most recent update. No matter how often I try to fix this issue by verifying the integrity of the files, restarting my pc, checking drivers, updates and anti virus, either the mirror or the camera drops my 50 frames to a whopping 9 or below. This has been happening in every world I join. I can't seem to pinpoint what the issue is. It only happens when either I look towards a mirror or look in a specific direction when my camera is out. Everything is totally fine when the mirror or camera is put away and I look around. Things are fine as well when I have the camera out and i'm not looking in the trigger spot for lag, even if the camera is faced in that direction. I have other friends of mine having the same issue but it doesn't seem like it's happening to everyone. This NEEDS to be fixed at some point because I can't record or stream anything with these bugs happening.",
